OL,3,ASeveral dead or injured in major fire
OL,4,Aat Canada military base
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral people have been killed as a
OL,7,Fresult of a large fire near a Canadian
OL,8,Fmilitary base in Alberta, the nation's
OL,9,Fdefence minister has said.
OL,11,FDavid McGuinty did not confirm the
OL,12,Fcause or the number of casualties,
OL,13,Fdescribing the situation as "very, very
OL,14,Factive and delicate". The Canadian
OL,15,Fmilitary and local authorities were
OL,16,Fmanaging the fire, he said.
OL,18,FCanadian Forces Base Wainwright, where
OL,19,Fthe fire broke out, is one of the
OL,20,Fcountry's busiest military training
OL,21,Fbases.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
