OL,3,ASeveral dead or injured in major fire
OL,4,Aat Canada military base
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanadian TV network Global News reports
OL,7,Fthat at least seven were killed and
OL,8,Fdozens more injured when a gas line or
OL,9,Fgas well was hit during a live-fire
OL,10,Ftraining exercise, citing unnamed
OL,11,Fmilitary sources.
